## 3. Recommended technology stack

| Component | Technology |
| --- | --- |
| Admin and public websites | React + Vite |
| Backend / API | Python + FastAPI |
| Database for prototype | SQLite |
| PDF storage | Local server folder initially |
| ESP32 firmware | Arduino framework using PlatformIO in VS Code |
| Fingerprint sensor | AS608 + compatible UART library |
| TFT display | ILI9488-compatible library |
| Communication | Wi-Fi + HTTP/HTTPS REST API |
| Testing | browser tests, API tests, hardware tests |
| Version control | Git + GitHub |

Important prototype decision:
- keep everything local at first
- run the backend and database on the same machine as development
- connect ESP32 to the same local Wi-Fi network
- secure remote deployment and HTTPS can be added later

